## 🎨 Code Quality

### Formatting

```bash
# Format code with Black
black .

# Sort imports with isort
isort .

# Or format everything at once
make format
```

### Linting

```bash
# Lint with flake8
flake8 .

# Lint with pylint
pylint **/*.py

# Or lint everything at once
make lint
```

### Type Checking

```bash
# Type check with mypy
mypy .

# Or use Make
make type-check
```

### Security Scanning

```bash
# Check for security vulnerabilities
bandit -r .
safety check

# Or use Make
make security
```

## 🔧 Development

### Pre-commit Hooks

Pre-commit hooks automatically run before each commit to ensure code quality:

```bash
# Install hooks (done automatically by setup script)
pre-commit install

# Run manually on all files
pre-commit run --all-files

# Or use Make
make pre-commit
```

### Environment Variables

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and configure your environment:

```bash
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your settings
```

